ilding the pot.\n\nReason: Since there is no bet to call, checking is the most prudent play. It allows you to see the Turn card for free to potentially improve your hand (hitting a Jack or 8) without risking chips on a bluff that might be called by a King or a better high card.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
